    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103313" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρᾰ-βάμων</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾱ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῆμα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>four-footed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					476
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀπήνα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέθριππον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				517
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. χαλαί</span> the hoofs <i>of
				horses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				808
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				792
			</span></i> (dub.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραβάμοσι γυίοις</span>
			in the shape <i>of a quadruped</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				376
			</span></i>. (
				Dor.
			; the 
				Att.
			-
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραβήμων</span> is not found: used by <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> only in lyr.)</div>
